{"id":"n32356-1-8","stage":2,"title":"경기장 · 体育场","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32356-1-8-1","ko":"날씨가 추운데 실내 경기장에서 배드민턴을 치는 게 어때요?","zh":"天气这么冷，去室内体育馆打羽毛球怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨가","audio":"/audio/7f36def9da34b4ea3404.mp3"}},{"text":"추운데","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"2","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추운데","audio":"/audio/6924e9cc82b9e32a468b.mp3"}},{"text":"실내","meaning":"室内","explanation":"실내：室内。","readings":[{"term":"실내","audio":"/audio/9082214effb119dbb66e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66282","senseId":"1","lemma":"실내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실내","audio":"/audio/9082214effb119dbb66e.mp3"}},{"text":"경기장에서","meaning":"体育场，赛场","explanation":"경기장：体育场，赛场；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"경기장","audio":"/audio/64779ec1adac56312973.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32356","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경기장에서","audio":"/audio/c0506badcf7bbc0e6eb6.mp3"}},{"text":"배드민턴을","meaning":"羽毛球","explanation":"배드민턴：羽毛球；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"배드민턴","audio":"/audio/6f5e74e44ac9373182e2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58809","senseId":"1","lemma":"배드민턴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배드민턴을","audio":"/audio/d45528ebccff025c31f9.mp3"}},{"text":"치는","meaning":"打，玩，抽","explanation":"치다：打，玩，抽；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","sen